<title>USA: KTI Inc Q3 share $0.21 vs $0.03.</title>
<headline>KTI Inc Q3 share $0.21 vs $0.03.</headline>
<dateline>GUTTENBERG, N.J. 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				Third Quarter	 September 30,</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	   1996	  1995</p>
<p>Total Revenues</p>
<p>		   $9,584,300 $9,825,000  $59,133,000 $28,148,000</p>
<p>Income (Loss) From Continuing Operations</p>
<p>		    1,292,800  (241,400)   15,518,500    (55,900)</p>
<p>Discontinued Operations</p>
<p>		     (35,800)    236,100    (254,000)     434,800</p>
<p> Extraordianary Item  N/A    147,800  (2,396,700)     147,800</p>
<p> Net Income     1,257,000    142,500   12,867,800     526,700</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share   0.21	 0.03	   2.11	  0.11</p>
<p>Weighted Average</p>
<p>  O/S Shares    6,110,900  5,428,700    6,097,500   4,903,300</p>
<p>Year-to-date revenues include a one time gain of $32 million that resulted from the restructuring, last May, of a long-term power purchase agreement between a KTI waste-to-energy subsidiary and an electric utility customer. The Company reported a net $13.8 million gain after deducting minority interest and other related costs.</p>
